{"3113350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodsmith", "steam_appid": 3113350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/e7977d84970c3452b5ac29ee98bb0671.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/e7977d84970c3452b5ac29ee98bb0671.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span><strong>Blood. Flesh. Cycles of death &amp; rebirth.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cursed ruins beneath the old cemetery have been dead for centuries, and yet nothing here stays that way. The undead roaming these halls were once people. The blood pooling in the stone cracks still moves. And somewhere below, something ancient is still breathing.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/1e4fa1f05699bfea06b9321117ab404f.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/1e4fa1f05699bfea06b9321117ab404f.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master blood manipulation or be consumed by it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim blood from fallen enemies or forge your own offence from your own blood. Burn, slash, impale and drain your way through hordes of the damned using an evolving arsenal of blood manipulation abilities. Every power you gain comes from something you survived. You grow stronger with every drop. So does the hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Ride the downward spiral</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper Quinton goes, the harder the story gets to look at. The ruins have a history. The monsters have names. And the thing waiting at the bottom didn't end up there by accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodsmith is a first-person action RPG about how far a person will go, and what's left of them when they get there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/912a844715ed9ee65cd35dcc57df0dd0.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/912a844715ed9ee65cd35dcc57df0dd0.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride the downward spiral</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper Quinton goes, the harder the story gets to look at. The ruins have a history. The monsters have names. And the thing waiting at the bottom didn't end up there by accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodsmith is a first-person action RPG about how far a person will go, and what's left of them when they get there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/8987e1ebf9f78e2993683c5a145e8f34.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/8987e1ebf9f78e2993683c5a145e8f34.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person combat built around a deep, upgradeable blood manipulation system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siphon, extract, burn, slash and crystallise enemies using blood as both weapon and resource</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A layered narrative that rewards exploration — lore found, never told</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating enemy design: every area introduces something you haven't seen before</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A descent structure — each level goes deeper, darker, and harder to come back from</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/e7977d84970c3452b5ac29ee98bb0671.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/e7977d84970c3452b5ac29ee98bb0671.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span><strong>Blood. Flesh. Cycles of death &amp; rebirth.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cursed ruins beneath the old cemetery have been dead for centuries, and yet nothing here stays that way. The undead roaming these halls were once people. The blood pooling in the stone cracks still moves. And somewhere below, something ancient is still breathing.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/1e4fa1f05699bfea06b9321117ab404f.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/1e4fa1f05699bfea06b9321117ab404f.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master blood manipulation or be consumed by it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim blood from fallen enemies or forge your own offence from your own blood. Burn, slash, impale and drain your way through hordes of the damned using an evolving arsenal of blood manipulation abilities. Every power you gain comes from something you survived. You grow stronger with every drop. So does the hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Ride the downward spiral</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper Quinton goes, the harder the story gets to look at. The ruins have a history. The monsters have names. And the thing waiting at the bottom didn't end up there by accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodsmith is a first-person action RPG about how far a person will go, and what's left of them when they get there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/912a844715ed9ee65cd35dcc57df0dd0.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/912a844715ed9ee65cd35dcc57df0dd0.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride the downward spiral</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper Quinton goes, the harder the story gets to look at. The ruins have a history. The monsters have names. And the thing waiting at the bottom didn't end up there by accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodsmith is a first-person action RPG about how far a person will go, and what's left of them when they get there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras/8987e1ebf9f78e2993683c5a145e8f34.avif?t=1785835345\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3113350/extras_big/8987e1ebf9f78e2993683c5a145e8f34.avif?t=1785835345 width=800 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person combat built around a deep, upgradeable blood manipulation system</p></li><li><